# Aperçu : fermer par la croix et par Retour
@cible android

restart
wait Accueil 20000
tap Rechercher
settle
type Rechercher dune
expect visible "Dune: Part Two" 20000

tap "Dune: Part Two"
settle
expect dialog "Dune: Part Two"
# Le résumé manquant des résultats de recherche est complété.
expect visible "Lecture"
tap Fermer
settle
expect closed "Dune: Part Two"

tap "Dune: Part Two"
settle
expect dialog "Dune: Part Two"
back
settle
expect closed "Dune: Part Two"
expect dialog Rechercher
expect noerrors
